{"ticker":"TXT","updated":"2026-10-24T00:22:57Z","profile":{"longName":"Textron Inc.","shortName":"Textron Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.textron.com","fullTimeEmployees":34000,"marketCap":13213754368,"trailingPE":14.468927,"forwardPE":10.6359415,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.8637005,"pegRatio":0.91,"targetMeanPrice":99.46667,"targetHighPrice":115.0,"targetLowPrice":86.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.03,"earningsGrowth":0.052,"grossMargins":0.17628999,"operatingMargins":0.08701,"profitMargins":0.06125,"totalRevenue":15299000320,"beta":0.908,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":101.57,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":71.87,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.1},"summary":"Textron Inc. operates in the aircraft, defense, industrial, and finance businesses worldwide. It operates in six segments: Textron Aviation, Bell, Textron Systems, Industrial, Textron eAviation, and Finance. The Textron Aviation segment manufactures, sells, and services business jets, turboprop and piston engine aircraft, and military trainer and defense aircraft, as well as offers maintenance, inspection, and repair services; commercial parts; and advanced flight training devices. The Bell segment supplies military and commercial helicopters, tiltrotor aircraft, and related spare parts and services. The Textron Systems segment offers unmanned aircraft systems, electronic systems and solutions, advanced marine crafts, piston aircraft engines, live military air-to-air and air-to-ship training, weapons and related components, and armored and specialty vehicles. The Industrial segment offers blow-molded solutions, including conventional plastic fuel tanks and pressurized fuel tanks; plastic tanks for catalytic reduction systems and other fuel system components; lightweight and composite pentatonic battery systems for use in electric vehicles primarily to automobile original equipment manufacturers; and golf cars, off-road utility vehicles, powersports products, light transportation vehicles, aviation ground support equipment, professional turf-maintenance equipment, and turf-care ","summary_zh":"德事隆公司在全球開​​展飛機、國防、工業和金融業務。該公司分為六個部門：德事隆航空部門、貝爾部門、德事隆系統部門、工業部門、德事隆電子航空部門和金融部門。德事隆航空部門製造、銷售公務機、渦輪螺旋槳飛機和活塞發動機飛機、軍用教練機和國防飛機並提供服務，並提供維護、檢查和維修服務；商業零件；以及先進的飛行訓練設備。貝爾部門提供軍用和商用直升機、傾轉旋翼機以及相關備件和服務。德事隆系統部門提供無人機系統、電子系統和解決方案、先進船舶、活塞飛機引擎、即時軍用空對空和空對艦訓練、武器和相關零件以及裝甲和特殊車輛。工業部門提供吹塑解決方案，包括傳統塑膠油箱和加壓油箱；用於催化還原系統和其他燃料系統部件的塑膠罐；主要面向汽車原始設備製造商，用於電動汽車的輕質複合五元電池系統；高爾夫球車、越野多用途車、動力運動產品、輕型運輸車輛、航空地面支援設備、專業維修設備和草坪護理","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":81.44,"h":81.63,"l":80.75,"c":80.76,"v":674600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":80.96,"h":81.65,"l":80.75,"c":81.38,"v":1187200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":81.37,"h":82.12,"l":81.15,"c":81.89,"v":679100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":82.11,"h":82.21,"l":79.79,"c":80.46,"v":935100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":80.41,"h":80.92,"l":79.84,"c":80.16,"v":1289700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":79.28,"h":79.93,"l":78.48,"c":79.53,"v":1906700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":79.42,"h":79.71,"l":78.99,"c":79.7,"v":1539600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":79.94,"h":81.33,"l":79.44,"c":81.33,"v":794600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":81.3,"h":82.18,"l":80.82,"c":81.45,"v":1646800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":81.48,"h":82.86,"l":80.25,"c":82.74,"v":1816000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":82.44,"h":82.44,"l":80.22,"c":80.53,"v":1068900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":80.4,"h":81.55,"l":80.16,"c":81.02,"v":950200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":81.08,"h":82.52,"l":80.61,"c":82.24,"v":1110600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":82.07,"h":82.33,"l":81.23,"c":81.23,"v":986900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":81.6,"h":82.66,"l":81.24,"c":82.23,"v":1806600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":82.95,"h":84.42,"l":82.06,"c":83.43,"v":1891300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":83.48,"h":84.72,"l":82.68,"c":82.71,"v":2065800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":83.03,"h":84.06,"l":82.91,"c":83.92,"v":1061900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":84.0,"h":84.08,"l":83.29,"c":83.62,"v":2488800},